<section class="about-page"><header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">THE PERSON IN THE MARGINS</p><h1>Less of a bio.<br><em>More of a hello.</em></h1></header><div class="about-body"><div><div class="prose"><h2>Hey, I’m {{ site.author }}.</h2><p>{{ site.about }}</p><p>I wanted a place for the things that don’t fit neatly anywhere else. Something a little quieter, with room to think out loud and change my mind.</p><p>That’s what this journal is. A collection of days, in no particular hurry to become anything more.</p><h2>What you’ll find here</h2><p><strong>Everyday</strong> — things seen, heard, and almost missed.</p><p><strong>Writings</strong> — thoughts that need a little more room.</p><p><strong>Fragments</strong> — lists, stray lines, and the beautifully unfinished.</p><p><strong>Space</strong> — cosmos, night skies, and looking upward.</p><p><strong>Automotive</strong> — machines in motion, cars, planes, and all things mechanical.</p><h2>Stay a little, if you like.</h2><p>Come back whenever, or <a href="{{ '/subscribe/' | url }}">follow the journal by email</a> for a quiet note when something new is published.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/' | url }}">Find something to read ↗</a></div><aside class="about-aside"><div class="author-mark large" aria-hidden="true">{{ site.author | first | upper }}<span>✳</span></div><p class="about-aside-note">A notebook.<br>A little attention.<br>Somewhere to begin.</p><span class="small-label">THAT’S MOST OF IT.</span></aside></div>{% if site.showExamples %}<p class="example-notice">This is starter copy. Make this page yours when you add your first entry.</p>{% endif %}</section>
